Note that the `putArtifact`, `removeArtifact`, `putAllArtifacts`, and `clear` methods acquire a write lock, while all other methods acquire a read lock. This allows multiple threads to read from the map concurrently, but only one thread at a time can modify it. The `main` method starts two threads to demonstrate these operations being performed concurrently.

